# X/Twitter session cookies from your browser (never commit real values).
# How to get them:
#   1. Log in to https://x.com in Chrome/Firefox
#   2. Open DevTools (F12) → Application → Cookies → https://x.com
#   3. Copy the values of auth_token and ct0
#
# AUTH_TOKEN is the session cookie (~40 hex chars).
# CT0 is the CSRF token (~160 hex chars).

AUTH_TOKEN=your_auth_token_here
CT0=your_ct0_here
